### Find a category by slug (expect 200, id 1)
# Slug tests assume a fresh `npm run seed`
GET http://localhost:3000/categories/slug/evening-wear

### Products of a category by slug (expect 200, 5 products)
GET http://localhost:3000/categories/slug/mens-shoes/products

### Unknown category slug (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/categories/slug/does-not-exist

### Products of an unknown category slug (expect 404, not [])
GET http://localhost:3000/categories/slug/does-not-exist/products

### Same slug as "Men's Shoes" gets -2 (expect 201, slug "mens-shoes-2")
POST http://localhost:3000/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mens Shoes"
}